/-!
# Erdős Problem 1047: reusable proved core

This file contains the certificate API, explicit low-degree witnesses, and upper
bounds used by the balanced induction. Declaration names are preserved from the
original main file. The all-degree construction and final public theorem are in
`Erdos1047MaxNonConvexFC`, which imports the induction after this core, avoiding
an import cycle.
-/

open Polynomial
open Filter
open Topology
open Erdos1047
open unitInterval
open Set
